                      <Value>1. All Purchase orders shall remain valid unless cancelled or amended mutually by both parties.
2. All deliveries must be accompanied by a delivery note with the Purchase order number referenced.
3. All goods shall confirm to the approved Technical Agreement and specifications (FPS and PLS).
4. Deliveries must be pre-booked with our warehouse at least 48hrs in advance of arrival.
5. Deliveries shall be accepted between 08:00 and 16:00 on working days only.
6. Supplier to carry out necessary checks for damages prior to dispatch.
7. We reserve the right to inspect goods within 14 days of receipt to raise claims for discrepancies.</Value>
